## Intuition
For each element I am at, either I can chose it or not.
Can I chose the current element depends upon the last element I choose and which direction I am heading in.
If I havent changed direction, then I can either chose bigger element than the last and keep the dir same or choose a smaller element and change the direction.
Once, direction is changed, I always have to chose the smaller element.
For all cases where the current element satisfies our need, we still may not chose it.
Classic DP solution.

